{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.avif?t=1756815416\" data-has-big width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with humanity already on its last legs, from the emptiness of space, they came.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybe its good that they are here to end the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >better to go out in a bang than a whimper right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/2624dbb047ec4e649d54f3003f2d969c.poster.avif?t=1756815416\" width=640 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/2624dbb047ec4e649d54f3003f2d969c.webm?t=1756815416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/2624dbb047ec4e649d54f3003f2d969c.mp4?t=1756815416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otherworldy entities:</strong>\u00a0Face towering beings that dwarf your tiny craft.  Each encounter is a puzzle, requiring a unique method of piloting your craft to close the distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hovercrafts:</strong> Your hovercraft is your life in the desert. Momentum, position and timing are the only thing keeping you alive. Weave through beams of light, swarms of projectiles and crushing strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A reason to feel important:</strong> We were promised tales of a great journey, of the ultimate battle between good and evil. As kids, we were told that maybe we weren't the heroes of the tales, but at least it was out there somewhere right? Maybe by piloting the hovercraft against them you can feel whole again, like you are not just a speck of sand drifting in this world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/945e017a31ca37834fe1e1384d055edc.avif?t=1756815416\" data-has-big width=1560 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867360?t=1756815416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867360?t=1756815416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/0f1409dfb48451ee3a48c835427348fc1f097d18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756815416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/0f1409dfb48451ee3a48c835427348fc1f097d18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756815416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867360/extras/9118aedf5d75d918749417fd2caade21.avif?t=1756815416\" data-has-big width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with humanity already on its last legs, from the emptiness of space, they came.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybe its goo